  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここまで長かったなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Man, it took forever to get here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It really did.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;、&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;, &lt;Mel&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あーあーあー、
せっかく都に来たでよ
ちーっと自由行動にしねが？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahhhhhh... We're finally stoppin'
by a town, huh? Then could I
get a little time to myself?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、そうだね！
少し、のんびりしよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Th-That's a good idea!
Let's relax for a while!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んだば、おらは
ぶーら、ぶーら、
散歩してくるだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, I'll be takin' a
nice, leisurely stroll.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あいつは、
いっつもあんなこと言って
どっか行きやがるな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's always saying stuff
like that and then going
off to who knows where.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クリュゥ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuuu...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね、&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ村&lt;White&gt;の時も
気がついたら橋の上にいて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's true. When we were in
Valhalla, he was standing on the
bridge before we even noticed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そしたら、
村人全員ビンタするーって
言ってて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then he said
he was going to
slap every villager...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まさかとは思うけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, he's not gonna...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>また何か考え込んで……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Does he have something in mind again...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>勝手に暴走してたラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If he goes on a rampage...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クッルール！　クッルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Colleuru! Colleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>様子見に行こうぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go check on him!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
